# ── Blog/avatar image uploads (Cloudinary) ───────────────────────────────────
# Free tier, no credit card. Sign up at https://cloudinary.com, then copy your
# Cloud name, API Key, and API Secret from the Dashboard. If these are empty
# the editor shows a clear "not configured" message instead of failing.
# ~25 free credits/mo ≈ 25 GB storage; 10 MB max per image.
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=""
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=""
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=""

# Optional: anonymised, cookie-free analytics via Plausible (plausible.io).
